  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, a wunderkind may spend a reality point in conjunction with one of her Illusion talents to will a part of the illusion into being, effectively permitting a portion of the Fey Realm to cross over into the Material Plane for a brief time. This functions as the Create Reality ability from the fey adept class from Spheres of Power, and improves at 12th and 18th levels, as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wunderkind#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
